   "text": "OD-B17-S03 on the rig desk. Each actor is a Subnet with one Minifig Rig: its generated choreography comes from assets/rig/OD-B17-S03/<actor>.json; the director's layer is the rig's own props (an offset per servo, a weight per body part), keyed in the Timeline against the Voice Track. Preview headless: cascade run rig-OD-B17-S03.cascade --frames 1-383 --fps 12. Export: node tools/rig_export.mjs OD-B17-S03."
